---
// IA before/after for idea-ai-wiki "05 Information Architecture" (tree style). Inline SVG inherits site fonts.
---
<figure class="ia">
  <div class="ia-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1300 1251" role="img" aria-labelledby="ia-t ia-d"><title id="ia-t">Information architecture, before and after</title><desc id="ia-d">Before: Guardian has four areas, Wiki home, Procedure page, Editor and a general Inbox where wiki suggestions are accepted or declined as a whole. After: Wiki home, Procedure page and Editor are all reworked; the procedure page adds key steps, version history and an automation usage count; the editor adds before-you-start fields, document import, suggested tags, content type and a duplicate check; a new Needs Review area holds a review queue and review editor; a new admin Automation settings area controls whether requesters see full text or an AI summary.</desc><text x="0" y="26" class="lbl">BEFORE</text><rect x="570.0" y="40" width="160" height="34" rx="6" class="n-same"/><text x="582.0" y="62" class="t-n-same b">Guardian</text><path d="M650.0 74 V100" class="ln"/><path d="M162.5 100 H1137.5" class="ln"/><path d="M162.5 100 V130" class="ln"/><circle cx="162.5" cy="130" r="3" class="dot"/><rect x="20.0" y="130" width="285.0" height="34" rx="6" class="n-same"/><text x="32.0" y="152" class="t-n-same b">Wiki home</text><path d="M30.0 164 V203.0 H46.0" class="ln"/><circle cx="46.0" cy="203.0" r="3" class="dot"/><rect x="46.0" y="186" width="259.0" height="34" rx="6" class="n-same"/><text x="58.0" y="208" class="t-n-same">Browse</text><text x="60.0" y="235" class="bul">· fixed category list</text><path d="M30.0 164 V277.0 H46.0" class="ln"/><circle cx="46.0" cy="277.0" r="3" class="dot"/><rect x="46.0" y="260" width="259.0" height="34" rx="6" class="n-same"/><text x="58.0" y="282" class="t-n-same">Filter tabs</text><text x="60.0" y="309" class="bul">· Mine · My teams</text><text x="60.0" y="326" class="bul">· Site-wide · Drafts</text><path d="M30.0 164 V368.0 H46.0" class="ln"/><circle cx="46.0" cy="368.0" r="3" class="dot"/><rect x="46.0" y="351" width="259.0" height="34" rx="6" class="n-same"/><text x="58.0" y="373" 